{
  "version": 1,
  "meta": {
    "titulo": "Del corte modal al R₁ — la cadena §5.1.2 → §5.2.2 → Ec. (1a/1b) → banda §5.12–§5.13 → Ec. (14), y la deriva del Note final (NCh2369:2025)",
    "ficha": "struct_pad/src/content/apuntes/ejemplo-analisis-sismico-cepa-nch2369.mdx",
    "esperadoFalso": {
      "v_bajo_maximo": "Es el hallazgo del §6 del post: el corte modal (599,2 kN) SUPERA el Q0máx de §5.13 (499,9 kN), y por eso la norma permite recortarlo un 16,6 % (factor 0,834). El ✗ es la tesis, no un defecto."
    }
  },
  "regions": [
    { "id": "r000", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 32, "src": "LA CEPA — del corte modal al R₁ efectivo, y la deriva que cierra el bucle (NCh2369:2025)" },
    { "id": "r001", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 80, "src": "Los DATOS del modelo son los del post: los dos modos del 2 GDL (períodos, formas, Γ y pesos modales de la tabla de §4). Todo lo demás —espectro, banda, R₁, capacidad y la deriva del Note final— se rehace en vivo." },
    { "id": "r002", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 128, "src": "— DATOS · gravedad por nivel (kN) y fracción de sobrecarga §5.1.2 —" },
    { "id": "r003", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 176, "src": "D_1 := 800 kN" },
    { "id": "r004", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 224, "src": "L_1 := 450 kN" },
    { "id": "r005", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 272, "src": "D_2 := 400 kN" },
    { "id": "r006", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 320, "src": "L_2 := 150 kN" },
    { "id": "r007", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 368, "src": "a := 0.25" },
    { "id": "r008", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 416, "src": "— DATOS · sitio y sistema (Tablas 3, 6 y 7; zona 3, suelo D, soldadas) —" },
    { "id": "r009", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 464, "src": "A_r := 0.56" },
    { "id": "r010", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 512, "src": "S := 1.00" },
    { "id": "r011", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 560, "src": "r := 3.50" },
    { "id": "r012", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 608, "src": "T_0 := 0.60 s" },
    { "id": "r013", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 656, "src": "p := 1.00" },
    { "id": "r014", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 704, "src": "q := 2.50" },
    { "id": "r015", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 752, "src": "T_suelo := 0.41 s" },
    { "id": "r016", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 800, "src": "I := 1.0" },
    { "id": "r017", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 848, "src": "R := 5" },
    { "id": "r018", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 896, "src": "xi := 0.02" },
    { "id": "r019", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 944, "src": "— DATOS · el modal del 2 GDL (tabla de §4 del post) y la geometría de la diagonal —" },
    { "id": "r020", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 992, "src": "T_1 := 0.1762 s" },
    { "id": "r021", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1040, "src": "T_2 := 0.0727 s" },
    { "id": "r022", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1088, "src": "W_1 := 1293.2 kN" },
    { "id": "r023", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1136, "src": "W_2 := 56.8 kN" },
    { "id": "r024", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1184, "src": "Gamma_1 := 0.8189" },
    { "id": "r025", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1232, "src": "phi_12 := 1.5239" },
    { "id": "r026", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1280, "src": "Gamma_2 := 0.1811" },
    { "id": "r027", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1328, "src": "phi_22 := -1.3687" },
    { "id": "r028", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1376, "src": "rho_12 := 0.0017" },
    { "id": "r029", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1424, "src": "costheta := 0.832" },
    { "id": "r030", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 1472, "src": "— 1 · peso sísmico §5.1.2 e irregularidad de masa §5.2.2 —" },
    { "id": "r031", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1520, "src": "P_1 := D_1 + a*L_1 = " },
    { "id": "r032", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1568, "src": "P_2 := D_2 + a*L_2 = " },
    { "id": "r033", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1616, "src": "P := P_1 + P_2 = kN" },
    { "id": "r034", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1664, "src": "razonMasa := P_1/P_2 = " },
    { "id": "v_irregular", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1712, "src": "v_irregular := razonMasa > 1.50 = " },
    { "id": "r036", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 1760, "src": "✓ = irregular de masa (el chute va en el nivel intermedio, no en el último) → análisis modal espectral." },
    { "id": "r037", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 1808, "src": "— 2 · R* por la rampa de la Ec. (1b) y espectro de diseño Ec. (1a) —" },
    { "id": "r038", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1856, "src": "CrT_1 := 0.16*R*T_suelo = " },
    { "id": "v_rampa", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1904, "src": "v_rampa := T_1 < CrT_1 = " },
    { "id": "r040", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1952, "src": "Rstar := 1.5 + (R - 1.5)*T_1/CrT_1 = " },
    { "id": "r041", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2000, "src": "f_xi := (0.05/xi)^0.4 = " },
    { "id": "r042", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2048, "src": "Sa_1 := A_r*S*(1 + r*(T_1/T_0)^p)/(1 + (T_1/T_0)^q) = " },
    { "id": "r043", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2096, "src": "C_1 := I*Sa_1*f_xi/Rstar = " },
    { "id": "r044", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2144, "src": "Sa_2 := A_r*S*(1 + r*(T_2/T_0)^p)/(1 + (T_2/T_0)^q) = " },
    { "id": "r045", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2192, "src": "C_2 := I*Sa_2*f_xi/Rstar = " },
    { "id": "r046", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 2240, "src": "— 3 · cortes modales, CQC (Ecs. 8 y 10) y el contraste con la Ec. (5) —" },
    { "id": "r047", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2288, "src": "Q_m1 := C_1*W_1 = " },
    { "id": "r048", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2336, "src": "Q_m2 := C_2*W_2 = " },
    { "id": "r049", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2384, "src": "Q_0 := sqrt(Q_m1^2 + Q_m2^2 + 2*rho_12*Q_m1*Q_m2) = " },
    { "id": "r050", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2432, "src": "Q_AEE := C_1*P = " },
    { "id": "r051", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2480, "src": "razonModal := Q_0/Q_AEE = " },
    { "id": "r052", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 2528, "src": "El modal da ~4 % menos que C·P: el chequeo de una línea que caza masa perdida o un espectro mal escalado." },
    { "id": "r053", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 2576, "src": "— 4 · la banda §5.12–§5.13 —" },
    { "id": "r054", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2624, "src": "Q_0min := 0.25*I*A_r*S*P = " },
    { "id": "r055", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2672, "src": "Q_0max := 2.75*I*A_r*S/(R + 1)*f_xi*P = " },
    { "id": "v_sobre_minimo", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2720, "src": "v_sobre_minimo := Q_0 >= Q_0min = " },
    { "id": "v_bajo_maximo", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2768, "src": "v_bajo_maximo := Q_0 <= Q_0max = " },
    { "id": "r058", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2816, "src": "factorRecorte := Q_0max/Q_0 = " },
    { "id": "r059", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 2864, "src": "El ✗ es el hallazgo: §5.13 permite (no obliga a) recortar un 16,6 %. El corte de diseño queda en Q_0max. No aplica a desplazamientos." },
    { "id": "r060", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 2912, "src": "— 5 · R₁ efectivo (Ec. 14) y lo que cuesta usar el R de la tabla —" },
    { "id": "r061", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2960, "src": "R_1 := Rstar*min(Q_0/Q_0min, 1) = " },
    { "id": "r062", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3008, "src": "cap := 0.7*R_1 = " },
    { "id": "r063", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3056, "src": "P_u := (Q_0max/2)/(2*costheta) = " },
    { "id": "r064", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3104, "src": "demanda_R1 := cap*P_u = " },
    { "id": "r065", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3152, "src": "demanda_Rtabla := 0.7*R*P_u = " },
    { "id": "r066", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3200, "src": "sobrecosto := demanda_Rtabla/demanda_R1 = " },
    { "id": "r067", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 3248, "src": "Escribir R₁ = 5 (el de la tabla) donde va el efectivo infla un 48 % la demanda de capacidad de todo lo que cuelga del fusible." },
    { "id": "r068", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 3296, "src": "— 6 · la deriva del Note final (§6.1: espectro de referencia, sin R*) —" },
    { "id": "r069", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3344, "src": "Sd_1 := I*Sa_1*f_xi*(9.80665 m/s^2)*(T_1/(2*pi))^2 = mm" },
    { "id": "r070", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3392, "src": "Sd_2 := I*Sa_2*f_xi*(9.80665 m/s^2)*(T_2/(2*pi))^2 = mm" },
    { "id": "r071", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3440, "src": "dr_1 := sqrt((Gamma_1*1*Sd_1)^2 + (Gamma_2*1*Sd_2)^2) = mm" },
    { "id": "r072", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3488, "src": "dr_2 := sqrt((Gamma_1*(phi_12 - 1)*Sd_1)^2 + (Gamma_2*(phi_22 - 1)*Sd_2)^2) = mm" },
    { "id": "r073", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3536, "src": "h := 4 m" },
    { "id": "r074", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3584, "src": "d_max := 0.015*h = mm" },
    { "id": "v_deriva1", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3632, "src": "v_deriva1 := dr_1 <= d_max = " },
    { "id": "v_deriva2", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3680, "src": "v_deriva2 := dr_2 <= d_max = " },
    { "id": "r077", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3728, "src": "uso_deriva := dr_1/d_max = " },
    { "id": "r078", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 3776, "src": "La cepa cumple la deriva usando el 16 %: en una arriostrada, la cláusula 6 confirma. Nota: Sd_1 y Sd_2 usan Sa·f_ξ SIN dividir por R* — el espectro de referencia de §6.1, no el de diseño." },
    { "id": "r079", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 3824, "src": "— CONTRASTES contra los números publicados en el post —" },
    { "id": "c_P", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3872, "src": "abs(P - 1350 kN) < 0.05 kN = " },
    { "id": "c_Rstar", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3920, "src": "abs(Rstar - 3.380) < 0.0005 = " },
    { "id": "c_C1", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3968, "src": "abs(C_1 - 0.463) < 0.0005 = " },
    { "id": "c_Qm1", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4016, "src": "abs(Q_m1 - 598.8 kN) < 0.05 kN = " },
    { "id": "c_Q0", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4064, "src": "abs(Q_0 - 599.2 kN) < 0.1 kN = " },
    { "id": "c_QAEE", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4112, "src": "abs(Q_AEE - 625.1 kN) < 0.05 kN = " },
    { "id": "c_Q0min", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4160, "src": "abs(Q_0min - 189.0 kN) < 0.05 kN = " },
    { "id": "c_Q0max", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4208, "src": "abs(Q_0max - 499.9 kN) < 0.05 kN = " },
    { "id": "c_factor", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4256, "src": "abs(factorRecorte - 0.834) < 0.0005 = " },
    { "id": "c_R1", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4304, "src": "abs(R_1 - 3.380) < 0.0005 = " },
    { "id": "c_cap", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4352, "src": "abs(cap - 2.366) < 0.0005 = " },
    { "id": "c_Pu", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4400, "src": "abs(P_u - 150.2 kN) < 0.05 kN = " },
    { "id": "c_dem1", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4448, "src": "abs(demanda_R1 - 355.4 kN) < 0.05 kN = " },
    { "id": "c_dem2", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4496, "src": "abs(demanda_Rtabla - 525.7 kN) < 0.05 kN = " },
    { "id": "c_dr1", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4544, "src": "abs(dr_1 - 9.9 mm) < 0.05 mm = " },
    { "id": "c_dr2", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4592, "src": "abs(dr_2 - 5.2 mm) < 0.05 mm = " },
    { "id": "c_uso", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4640, "src": "abs(uso_deriva - 0.16) < 0.005 = " }
  ]
}
